\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces The counting of \cref  {lem:cells-density,lem:redistribution}, drawn in the plane for a saturated packing of unit discs, to scale. Every cell lies within $2$ of its centre, so the cells of the centres in $B_R$ (blue) lie in $B_{R+2}$. In the sum of the transfers over the centres in $B_R$, every pair inside $B_R$ cancels; what remains are the pairs drawn in orange, from a centre in the shell $R-r<|c|\le R$ (green) to a centre outside $B_R$, and their number grows like the area of the shell, one power of $R$ below the number of centres.}}{14}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
