\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces The certificate, as \cref  {prop:verified} reads it. (a) The two-point polynomial $\sigma _2$ on $[-1,\tfrac  12]$, evaluated exactly from the deposited rational coefficients and scaled by its maximum: it is nonnegative, it vanishes to first order at $-1$ and $\tfrac  12$ and to second order at $-\tfrac  12$ and $0$, and nowhere else; the insets show the two double zeros, where the curve touches the axis without crossing it. (b) The same on a logarithmic scale. (c) The orders of the $127$ positive definite blocks, the sixty kernel blocks $X_\lambda $ and the sixty-seven sum-of-squares multipliers; the largest is $350\times 350$.}}{39}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
